Ladies and Gentlemen, Welcome to our magical show!

708
01:02:35,630 --> 01:02:42,430
スポットライトを浴びて 輝きを放つ
Basking in the spotlight, radiating brilliance.

709
01:02:42,430 --> 01:02:48,030
エンタシスよりプリズム 分光をスタンバイ
From entasis to prism, preparing the spectrum standby.

710
01:02:48,030 --> 01:02:53,130
この鈍色の空に 七色の橋を架けて見せましょう
Across this lead-gray sky, let me build a rainbow bridge for you.

711
01:02:54,130 --> 01:02:57,430
さあさ、とくとご覧あれ！
Come now, feast your eyes upon this!

712
01:02:57,430 --> 01:03:02,230
目に映るもの、今を彩るから
Because everything reflected in your eyes will color the present.

713
01:03:02,230 --> 01:03:09,030
大きな絵筆で描き出す 大胆なパースの中
Sketching out with a giant paintbrush within bold perspectives,

714
01:03:09,030 --> 01:03:15,630
鳴呼 びしょ濡れの舞台は ミラクルなパレット
Ah, this drenched stage is a miraculous palette!

715
