マスカレイドな第二部の開演
Curtain rises on Act Two, a masquerade—

716
01:03:26,830 --> 01:03:28,930
Shall we dance?

717
01:03:28,930 --> 01:03:32,430
モノトーンから極彩色に
From monotone into vivid hues,

718
01:03:32,430 --> 01:03:36,030
アシンメトリーなグラデーションで
With an asymmetrical gradation,

719
01:03:36,030 --> 01:03:39,430
夢中になってほしいの
I want you to be completely captivated.

720
01:03:39,430 --> 01:03:43,030
雨雲にマーブリング
Marbling across the rainclouds,

721
01:03:43,030 --> 01:03:46,130
目を奪われたその隙
While your eyes are dazzled,

722
01:03:46,130 --> 01:03:49,430
イリュージョンをスタンバイ
Setting the illusion on standby.

723
01:03:49,430 --> 01:03:54,130
ところで皆さん、なくし物はございませんか？
By the way, everyone, haven't you lost something?

724
01:03:54,630 --> 01:03:58,030
どなた様もおいでませ！
Welcome, one and all!

725
01:03:58,030 --> 01:04:02,230
あの手この手で魅了していくから
I'll enchant you with every trick in the book!

726
01:04:02,230 --> 01:04:06,430
一足お先に まんまと
One step ahead, effortlessly,

727
01:04:06,430 --> 01:04:10,130
盗みだすわ あなたの心を
I will steal your heart away!

728
01:04:10,130 --> 01:04:16,230
光を放ち出す きらめきのパレット
Unleashing radiant light, a glittering palette!

729
01:04:16,630 --> 01:04:22,130
さてさて！いよいよ大詰め、クライマックスに向けて盛り上がってまいりましょう！
Now then, now then! We're nearing the grand finale, let's get hyped for the climax!

730
01:04:22,130 --> 01:04:24,430
Listen!

731
01:04:24,830 --> 01:04:31,130
OK, 5・4・3・2・1 Go on the Show!
OK, 5, 4, 3, 2, 1, go on the show!

732
01:04:36,630 --> 01:04:42,430
最大級のキャンヴァスに描き出す
Painting across the grandest canvas,

733
