734
01:04:51,630 --> 01:04:55,030
さあさ、とくとご覧あれ！
Come now, feast your eyes upon this!

735
01:04:55,030 --> 01:04:59,430
次元の壁を超えて閃くから
Transcending dimensional walls, sparking with inspiration!

736
01:04:59,430 --> 01:05:02,630
大きな絵筆で描き出す
Sketching out with a giant paintbrush...

737
01:05:03,511 --> 01:05:07,411
大胆な パースの中 さあ
In this bold perspective, come on!

738
01:05:07,411 --> 01:05:12,311
みんなで大団円 迎えに行こう
Let's all go welcome the grand finale!

739
01:05:12,511 --> 01:05:20,511
嗚呼 びしょ濡れの舞台は ミラクルなパレット
Ah, this soaking wet stage is a miracle palette!

740
01:05:21,011 --> 01:05:25,011
Woah...

